OL,3,GNEWSALime apologises to blind couple
OL,4,Aover blocked path
OL,5,
OL,6,FE-bike company Lime has apologised to a
OL,7,Fblind couple after an app glitch led to
OL,8,Fbikes being left to block pavements in
OL,9,Fsouth-east London.
OL,11,FJessica and Jason Beal, who live in
OL,12,FPenge, said an influx of e-bikes left
OL,13,Fon footpaths created dangerous hazards.
OL,15,FDescribing a recent encounter on his
OL,16,Froute, Jason said an abandoned bike
OL,17,Fforced him to go into the busy main
OL,18,Froad with his guide dog.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
