OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALime apologises to blind couple
OL,4,Aover blocked path
OL,5,
OL,6,FBromley Council does not permit Lime to
OL,7,Foperate in the borough. However, a
OL,8,Fnow-fixed issue with Lime's app
OL,9,Fmistakenly enabled users to start and
OL,10,Fend rentals in Penge, which borders the
OL,11,Fneighbouring borough of Lewisham where
OL,12,Fthe service is authorised.
